  unitName: "Benimaru Nikaido (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 840177
  unitNumber: 8218
  description: A fighter with electrifying good looks, Benimaru's investigation into
    a mysterious tournament led him around the world, chasing the cold trail of a
    villain. Yet at every step, something kept nudging at his warrior's instincts
    to keep on going. He finally arrived at a derelict building in the middle of
    nowhere, with strange symbols that only he could see leading him far into its
    depths. At its very heart, he found a pitch-black portal yawning open, with a
    familiar friend stepping into it. Surprised, he followed his friend into the
    portal only to have his mind attacked by an overwhelming rage.
  summonDesc: My reason for victory?<br>I'm cool and you know it!
  fusionDesc: Don't blink,<br>you might miss my brilliance!
  evoDesc: Victory is mine!<br>Cool as ice, and just as shockingly awesome!
